        // ======

        // ======
        // FEATURE D10: Structural Normalizers (Acts, Sequences, Scenes, Beats)
        // ======

        // Use complete words from the first sentence when an extracted fact has no title.


        // ======
        // FEATURE B6.9: Sequence Output Completeness Normalizer & Auto-Patcher
        // ======




        // ============================================================================
        // MULTI-TIERED MEMORY ENGINE & GRAPHRAG (TIER 1 - 4 ARCHITECTURE)
        // Tier 1: Relational Knowledge Graph (The Matrix: Nodes & Edges)
        // Tier 2: Semantic Event Log (Vector Store / Event Chronology)
        // Tier 3: Pre-Flight Router (Compiles <active_state> block)
        // Tier 4: Dedicated Continuity Auditor (Surgical regex/patch validation)
